      "text": "Frequency once per day\n\n---\nEffect The shrine maiden nocks an arrow and whispers a soft chant under her breath before unleashing a torrent of holy power in the form of dozens of ghostly glowing arrows. Creatures in a 60-foot line take 10d6 force damage (DC 28 basic Reflex save save). On a critical failure, the creature is also Immobilized (escape dc=28) for 1 minute.",
